    (v_chapter, 'mcq', 'scenario', 'bank', 5, 'An iron gate near the sea rusts faster than the same gate in a dry city. The main reason is:', '["Higher temperature near sea","Presence of salty moisture","Lack of oxygen","Excess sunlight"]'::jsonb, 'B', 1, '4e7ac1981374', null),
    (v_chapter, 'mcq', 'scenario', 'bank', 5, 'A student places a clean iron nail in copper sulphate solution. After some time, a brown layer appears on the nail. This shows that iron:', '["Is reduced","Is less reactive than copper","Displaces copper from solution","Prevents oxidation"]'::jsonb, 'C', 1, 'c3f78fa4c52a', null),
    (v_chapter, 'mcq', 'scenario', 'bank', 5, 'During electroplating of a spoon with silver, the spoon is connected to the:', '["Anode","Cathode","Salt bridge","Positive terminal only"]'::jsonb, 'B', 1, '111ff5cd6d30', null),
